    "/dunst/recommends/2005/05_10_08_berlin_in_sane/berlin_in_sane_presstext.html": {
      "main": "/dunst/recommends/2005/05_10_08_berlin_in_sane/berlin_in_sane_presstext.html",
      "main_lines": [
        "dunst Recommends:",
        "8. Oktober 2005",
        "THE YEAR III - FIRST TIME ON TOUR - EUROPE 2005 English - Spanish - Dutch and German Mags & Newspapers are writing: \"BERLIN INSANE is on the way to become a movement !\" A compilation of Sex Rock & Sleazy Electronics for a new generation of Dj´s and Live Performers compiled by \"THE SCANDALS\" (Emma Eclectic & Steve Morell) and they tell everyone who dont like it : \"We dont hate you - we just dont even care\" It starts on the October 6th with The Berlin Insane Warm-Up Party at Chantal`s House of Shame www.kinzo-berlin.de with the glorious Miss Fish and Minimal Martin. Doors open at 11 pm...watch out for more... The official Berlin Insane Record Release Party ! LIVE: Crossover (Gigolo Rec.), Mitte Kill (Berlin), Taylor Savvy (Canada/Berlin), Noblesse Oblige (Horseglue, Pale Music, London), Mignon (Pale Music), The Nothings (White Trash, Berlin), Thom Revolver (Amsterdam), Bruda & Kronstädta (P-Pack), Autonervous feat. Bettina Köster (Malaria), Sexo Y Droga (9 Rec.), Kesseteens (Duplikat) Special appereance by Glamour to Kill (Pale Music/Subterfuge) DJ: The Scandals (Pale Music), Neonman (1st Decade, Lasergun, Pale Music), Eric D. Clark (Whirpool Production), Kook (Pale Music, Klangsucht, Berlin), Adam Sky (Adamski, Barcelona), John Taylor (Punx Soundcheck, Pale Music, London), DJ Humus (Pale Music), Sean McLusky (Mute) and...Krylon Superstar (Berlin), Die Hure von Babylon (Berlin) Art and Visuals: Jim Avignon, Alexandra Lebus, Danielle de Picciotto, NAB (notchandbead), Isidor, Patrick & Kitty (Cloé & Marty) But don`t think that's all folks! The Berlin Insane Party goes on and on. Enjoy the Insane Sunday - Manic Monday Afterhour with Eric D. Clark at Pfefferberg, Haus 13. www.manycmonday.de Berlin Insane is going to rule the world. We start in Berlin and than it goes to Rostock, Düsseldorf, Stuttgart, Essen, Prag, Basel, London, the Netherlands and Spain. More countries to come. Bookers all over the world, WE STILL HAVE OPEN DATES FOR YOU!!! Contact: eliepale-music.com For Promos of Berlin Insane III send mail to promopale-music.com Don`t believe the hype: tons of Queers will FUCK YOUR ASSES! And if NOT, you gonna fuck theirs !!! Supported, featured and sponsered by: NIL, Art, Lee, Tradewinds, Pilsener Urquell, Intergroove, Dermot`o´Dyna, Blue Moon, Sonic Seducer, Dussmann, Twen FM, Motor FM, Radio Fritz, Prinz, Squeeze Mag, Blitzkleid.de, 030 Mag, Wahrschauer Mag, L'Etoile Noire, sch(V)ice Mag, Lowdown, Shitkatapult, Gigolo, Groove, Nachtagenten, Dorfdisco, Rio, Rafgier, Rough Trade Shops, Pale Music INT. and of course the CLUB 103 Wanna look absolutely fabulous? Get the new Berlin Insane merchandise by Little Miss Luzifer!"
      ],
      "gallery": []
    },
